{
 "meta": {
  "lane": "b",
  "task": "t120",
  "chunk": "b/056",
  "family": "WAR20"
 },
 "entries": [
  {
   "key": "u17826",
   "en": "We just arrived a short time ago. It seemed like any other colony at first, but it's different somehow.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17827",
   "en": "Ah, it's hard to explain. It's kind of like.... I can't describe it. You should speak with Fai Dan. He knows the colony better than me.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17828",
   "en": "No. Well, just ship diagnostics. It's nothing. I should get back to it. Fai Dan wants a report on.... I should go.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17829",
   "en": "No. Thanks, really. Now please, I need to get back to work.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17830",
   "en": "What do you know about the colony?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17831",
   "en": "It looks like you're monitoring something.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17832",
   "en": "Maybe I can help you. What are you trying to diagnose?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17833",
   "en": "Different?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17834",
   "en": "I won't let you. You must not enter!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17835",
   "en": "You'll have to forgive my wife. Calantha is not in her right mind. She just needs to relax and accept what's happened.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17836",
   "en": "The constant attacks have strained us all. She'll adapt. We all have.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17837",
   "en": "I'm a medic. Or I am since the doctor died. I've tried my best since she was killed.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17838",
   "en": "Just what I was told by Colonial Affairs. It's a little... different from what they claimed.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17839",
   "en": "It's not all bad, though. When the geth are gone, we'll have a chance to create something even more spectacular than before.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17840",
   "en": "I can't think of any reason for an attack like this. We just wanted to build a home.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17841",
   "en": "Please, do what you can to stop the attacks.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17842",
   "en": "Commander. Is there something I can help you with?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17843",
   "en": "I'm free. Thank you for giving me my mind back.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17844",
   "en": "It was awful. Every time I thought about speaking out... even the memory is painful.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17845",
   "en": "We can make this colony work, we just need to build it for ourselves.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17846",
   "en": "After a while, we just instinctively did what the Thorian wanted.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17847",
   "en": "Nothing but bad memories here.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17848",
   "en": "I've had enough of this. There's got to be an easier way to make a living.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17849",
   "en": "What happened to your wife?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17850",
   "en": "What do you do for the colony?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17851",
   "en": "Do you know anything about this planet?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17852",
   "en": "Wife's condition",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17853",
   "en": "I'm what passes for a medic until we can get all of the survivors together. I hear Juliana's alive. She's much more experienced than I am.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17854",
   "en": "You've been through this yourself. It's always a shame when a colony fails, isn't it?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17855",
   "en": "But I suppose you tried. That's more than most did.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17856",
   "en": "No. She just needs... time. Time to absorb everything. We'll be fine.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17857",
   "en": "I can't tell you much about that. You'd best ask Fai Dan if you really must know.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17858",
   "en": "Fai Dan is our leader. Who better to answer questions about the colony?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17859",
   "en": "Is there anything I can do for her?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17860",
   "en": "Why can't you tell me? I just want to know about the colony.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17861",
   "en": "My wife needs rest. The attacks are making things worse.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17862",
   "en": "It's just too much to take.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17863",
   "en": "I wish they would just leave us alone.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17864",
   "en": "You don't want to go down there!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17865",
   "en": "Free. I can't believe I'm free.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17866",
   "en": "That was a nightmare.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17867",
   "en": "No one should ever feel pain like that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17868",
   "en": "I really need a vacation.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17869",
   "en": "This one is no longer fit. We should leave him.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17870",
   "en": "He's lost it. We should just leave him be.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17871",
   "en": "Let's leave him. There's nothing we can do for him.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17872",
   "en": "Let's go. He can't help us.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17873",
   "en": "Just leave him. He's completely mad.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17874",
   "en": "Help me? No. No one can help me now.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17875",
   "en": "I've thought about that. Several times.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17876",
   "en": "I would rather die fighting.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17877",
   "en": "Not that kind of fight. It's like running through a thorn bush. The more you struggle....",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17878",
   "en": "Time's up. Company's coming.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17879",
   "en": "Ask Fai Dan. Ask him about the-- aaaaagh!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17880",
   "en": "Heads up!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17881",
   "en": "No more! I want to be free!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17882",
   "en": "I'm taking control. It's my life!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17883",
   "en": "I won't. I won't do it. I won't. I can't-- I can't-- I won't do it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17884",
   "en": "My mind is my own. My mind is my own. My mind is my own.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17885",
   "en": "NGAH!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17886",
   "en": "It'll all be over soon. No more pain. No more....",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17887",
   "en": "Nothing I should be, and anything I shouldn't.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17888",
   "en": "Maybe I will stop you. How would you like that?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17889",
   "en": "I could tell you. Tell you everything. How would you like that?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17890",
   "en": "NOOOOO!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17891",
   "en": "That was a good one. Very intense.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17892",
   "en": "Just invoking the master's whip.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17893",
   "en": "Helps remind me I'm still alive.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17894",
   "en": "You're here for the geth, aren't you? You're not the only one interested in those... things.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17895",
   "en": "Well, don't stay too long or time will be all you haaaaaave-- aaagh!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17896",
   "en": "Not looking for; looking to get rid of.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17897",
   "en": "They're a thorn in the side of the-- wlaaagh! Agh!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17898",
   "en": "Trying to get to the-- aaaaiiee!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17899",
   "en": "Gyahh-ha-ha-ha! Ahahahahaha!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17900",
   "en": "What are you doing down here?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17901",
   "en": "You're not stopping me.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17902",
   "en": "What's back there?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17903",
   "en": "What's the matter with you?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17904",
   "en": "Who else is looking for the geth?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17905",
   "en": "Is there anything I can do to help you? Do you even want help?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17906",
   "en": "Maybe I should just put him out of his misery.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17907",
   "en": "Fighting what?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17908",
   "en": "I could help you if you told me what you're fighting.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17909",
   "en": "Fighting?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17910",
   "en": "You're a little strange.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17911",
   "en": "I'm sorry, but I can't stop to talk. I have to deal with the water shortage.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17912",
   "en": "The utilities building was one of the first to fall under geth control.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17913",
   "en": "Find the mains and turn them back on. Until then, this colony is dry.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17914",
   "en": "Still no water. A colony needs water to grow.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17915",
   "en": "We are a small group, part of a larger colony. Before the geth attacked.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17916",
   "en": "I wish you luck.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17917",
   "en": "I can think... without pain. Thank you. You've given us a second chance.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17918",
   "en": "Have you given any thought to helping us with our water troubles?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17919",
   "en": "The geth are gone, we've got water again. Everything's good.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17920",
   "en": "You are very focused on the water, despite the constant attacks.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17921",
   "en": "The pressure is getting to her. Can't say I blame her.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17922",
   "en": "The water started running not long ago. Thanks to you, I assume.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17923",
   "en": "Now we just need to deal with the geth and we can get back to growing this colony.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17924",
   "en": "You've already helped us, but there's a bigger threat out there.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17925",
   "en": "We have water. I hope we live to enjoy the benefits of it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17926",
   "en": "Restoring the water supply was a great help, but it means nothing if the geth kill us all.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17927",
   "en": "It's nice to have more mundane worries. Like getting that water flowing again.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17928",
   "en": "The colony can't afford to lose any more of us. We're just too vulnerable.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17929",
   "en": "Really? I'll need to get the relays going, then.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17930",
   "en": "Once the water is flowing again, we can wait for ExoGeni's money to roll in.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17931",
   "en": "I'm free again. Thank you, for everything.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17932",
   "en": "I'd forgot what it was like to have a thought of my own.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17933",
   "en": "It will take time for things to get back to normal around here.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17934",
   "en": "Our water shortage doesn't matter much any more. This colony is dead.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17935",
   "en": "There's not much point in sticking around here.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17936",
   "en": "We could have been a shining beacon for other colonies.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17937",
   "en": "This planet will be deserted soon enough.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17938",
   "en": "You should speak to Fai Dan. It is his responsibility. He knows the colony best.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17939",
   "en": "I-- I can't think of anything else. So much has happened, but-- but it hurts.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17940",
   "en": "If I stay focused on this task, the pain goes away.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17941",
   "en": "An understandable reaction, though her discomfort seems almost palpable.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17942",
   "en": "I understand the discomfort she feels. The threat is very real.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17943",
   "en": "Her discomfort seems very real. Constant threat will do that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17944",
   "en": "Her discomfort seems very real. These people have been through a lot.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17945",
   "en": "You can turn on the water mains yourself.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17946",
   "en": "The water's back on again.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17947",
   "en": "I'll look into it if I have time.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17948",
   "en": "You know where to find the problem with the water.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17949",
   "en": "Unless you plan to make a trip every few days, that wouldn't really solve our problem. We need to be self-sufficient.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17950",
   "en": "We could wait for ExoGeni ships if we wanted a handout. We need to be self-sufficient.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17951",
   "en": "I could bring in what you need with the Normandy.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17952",
   "en": "I have a ship fueled and ready to go. I could bring water in.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17953",
   "en": "I could fly water in.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17954",
   "en": "Do it yourself.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17955",
   "en": "You think of nothing else?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17956",
   "en": "It's safe now.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17957",
   "en": "I'll keep it in mind.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17958",
   "en": "Water's on.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17959",
   "en": "Here. A few credits for your trouble. Thank you again, Commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17960",
   "en": "I'd rather not. This is not the time or the place. Please, help us or don't. Otherwise, leave me to my work.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17961",
   "en": "I am not the one to ask about that. Ask Fai Dan, or one of the others.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17962",
   "en": "If we don't die of thirst, the geth will surely kill us all.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17963",
   "en": "They just keep coming.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17964",
   "en": "I can't get the water back on until the geth are removed.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17965",
   "en": "They must be stopped.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17966",
   "en": "What do you know about this planet?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17967",
   "en": "Thanks for your help, Commander. Here's a small payment for your trouble.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17968",
   "en": "No sense fixing this damn thing, if we're leaving anyway.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17969",
   "en": "I knew they'd turn up eventually! Here. Fai Dan gave me some requisition money. It's all yours.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17970",
   "en": "Now, if I can kick these power cells into place, I'll have this colony up and running in no time.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17971",
   "en": "Your top-of-the-line ship doesn't use the same parts as the old generator we've got. The cells just aren't compatible.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17972",
   "en": "How's a woman supposed to think with guns going off all around?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17973",
   "en": "Finally, that damn thing is out of my head. I can think without pain.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17974",
   "en": "I still need the power cells for this generator, though.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17975",
   "en": "Unless you've got something important, shoo. I'm trying to jury rig something to replace the missing power cells.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  }
 ]
}
